THAT: Token-wise High-frequency Augmentation Transformer for
Hyperspectral Pansharpening
IEEE SMC 2025. DOI: 10.1109/SMC58881.2025.11343459.

Attribution
-----------
The convolutional QKV attention formulation builds on DRSformer:
https://github.com/cschenxiang/DRSformer

The window-attention components derive from a HAT/TTST-based backbone.
Attribution to these projects is retained independently of repository structure.

